      "type": "text",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Malte Maas — Capture Director, Animator & Technical Artist. Passion for performance-driven imagery: from early 3D experiments in the late 1990s through the first dedicated 3D company to HUMANOID Capture Studio today.",
        "Focus: motion capture direction, real-time and offline character pipelines, 360° video capture, and full 3D production for brands, agencies, museums, and game studios.",
        "Based in Düsseldorf, Germany. Projects delivered for broadcast, interactive, VR, and long-form commercial work across Europe."
